%% Source for request-sequence.svg. Render from assets/diagrams/:
%% npx @mermaid-js/mermaid-cli@11.4.0 -i request-sequence.mmd -o request-sequence.svg -c mermaid.config.json -b white
sequenceDiagram
    actor You
    participant TUI as tui.py (InteractiveMode)
    participant Session as session.py (AgentSession)
    participant Compaction as compaction.py
    participant AgentLoop as agent_loop.py
    participant Model as model_runtime.py and ai.py
    participant LLM as LLM server
    participant Tool as Your tool (extension)

    You->>TUI: 1 · Fix the failing test
    TUI->>Session: prompt(text)
    Note over Session: auto_compact(): compact first if needed
    Note over Session: 2 · the tools come from pi.tools (your extensions)
    Session->>AgentLoop: run(context, config, emit)
    loop until an answer has no tool calls
        AgentLoop->>Model: 3, 4 · stream_fn(model, context)
        Model->>LLM: 5 · POST /chat/completions, streamed
        LLM-->>Model: text, thinking and tool calls, in pieces
        Model-->>AgentLoop: deltas, then the whole assistant message
        AgentLoop-->>Session: emit(message events)
        Session-->>TUI: events, drawn as they stream
        Note over Session: 8 · save() appends each finished message to the .jsonl file
        AgentLoop->>AgentLoop: 6 · validate_tool_arguments(tool, arguments)
        AgentLoop->>Session: 6 · before_tool_call(call, args)
        Note over Session: every tool_call listener runs, and a reason blocks the call
        AgentLoop->>Tool: 7 · execute(params, ctx)
        Tool-->>AgentLoop: a string, or an exception (error result)
        AgentLoop-->>Session: emit(tool_execution_end, the result message)
        Session-->>TUI: the tool box turns green or red
        Note over AgentLoop: 8 · the result joins the messages for the next request
        AgentLoop->>Session: prepare_next_turn()
        opt context > contextWindow - reserveTokens
            Session->>Compaction: find_cut(), summarize(older messages)
            Compaction->>Model: stream_fn(summary request, no tools)
            Model-->>Compaction: the summary
            Compaction-->>Session: summary
            Note over Session: messages = [summary, newest messages]
            Session-->>TUI: the "Compacted" box
        end
    end
    AgentLoop-->>Session: emit(agent_end)
    Session-->>TUI: events
    TUI-->>You: the answer, then the editor again
